ciphertext = AES-GCM-Icciitii(furtuu_kutaa, nonce, CBOR_payload, aad=id_kutaa)

Fureemii fan-out: { gosa:"m", kutaa, ergaa:{id, ct, nonce, ergituu_fakkeessaa, ergame_at} }

files.h2_f:
init POST /api/faayilota/deebi'ee kan hojjetamu/jalqaba {maqaa faayilii, guddina, akeekkachiisa_guddina_chunk}
            ← {id_alkaa'uu, guddina_chunk}
chunk PUT /api/faayilota/deebi'ee kan jalqabamu/{id_upload}/chunk/{offset} <ct bytes>
            ← 204 irratti
xumuruu POST /api/faayilota/deebi'ee kan jalqabamu/{upload_id}/xumura {plain_blake3}
            ← 201 {faayilii_id, url} .
TTL irratti hin xumuramne: 24 h

