apns.h1_f:
POST https://api.push.apple.com/3/meeshaa/<mallattoo_meeshaa>
Mataduree: apns-mata duree: <bundle_id>, apns-dhiibuu-gosa: akeekkachiisa, apns-collapse-id: kutaa:42
Qaama: {aps: {akeekkachiisa: {mata duree, qaama}}, deetaa: <chaappeffame>}

bmp.h1_f:
id_sanduuqa_poostaa = HKDF(furtuu_maxxansaa_fudhataa, odeeffannoo="bmp-v1", len=32)
Kuufama: POST /bmp/kuufama {id_sanduuqa poostaa, blob ≤1MB}
Fudhachuu: GET /bmp/ergaawwan (auth'd)

